      "entry_point": "A local cheater supplies a user-edited .defence file through the menu Load action (ApoDefenceOptions.java:170-172), replaces the automatically loaded user.dir/levels/Original_First.defence file (ApoDefenceGame.java:176), or recreates the public submission protocol exposed by ApoDefenceHighscore.send() (ApoDefenceHighscore.java:166-203).",
